# Islamic App (if12is)

Flutter Islamic app. Repo: https://github.com/if12is/islamic-app (account **if12is**).
Read `AGENTS.md` for the full map. Write code and agent docs in English.

## Run during development

```bash
flutter pub get
flutter devices
flutter run
```

Hot reload `r`, hot restart `R`. Web preview: `flutter run -d chrome`.

## Layout

- `lib/main.dart` — entry, Hive/Dio, `ProviderScope`
- `lib/core/` — constants, l10n, theme, services, failures
- `lib/features/<name>/{domain,data,presentation}` — feature-first Clean Architecture
- `lib/shared/providers/` — theme, locale, first launch, location
- Live nav is `HomePage` IndexedStack (Home / Quran / Azkar / Settings). `app_router.dart` is a stub.

## GitHub APK

Push `master` builds a release APK and **deletes/recreates** rolling release `apk-latest`.
Versioned (kept) release only when opted in:

- `./scripts/release.sh 1.1.0+2`
- `git tag v1.1.0 && git push origin v1.1.0`
- commit body/title contains `[release]`
- Actions dispatch: `create_versioned_release=true`

Skip CI APK with `[skip apk]`. Do not delete `v*` releases. Do not switch remotes away from if12is.
